    {
      "name": "Concealing Condensation",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The kaylix opens gill-like vents on the side of its neck and releases hot, moist air that forms a concealing cloud of white mist in a 20ft Type:emanation centered on its location. This mist lingers until the end of the kaylix's next turn. All creatures within the mist become Concealed, and all creatures outside the mist become concealed to creatures within it.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Pounce",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The kaylix Strides and makes a Strike at the end of that movement. If the kaylix began this action Hidden, it remains hidden until after the attack.</p>",
